#: ../../source/agents/cursor_cloud_supplement.md:1
msgid "Cursor Cloud supplement"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/cursor_cloud_supplement.md:3
msgid ""
"The rules below apply only when running inside a Cursor Cloud VM. The "
"cloud VM update script appends this file to `AGENTS.md` at provisioning "
"time, so the rest of the agent context is the same as a local checkout. "
"Local developers and other agents should ignore this section — it is not "
"relevant outside the cloud VM. Anything that already lives in `AGENTS.md`"
" must not be repeated here; only cloud-VM-specific bootstrap, "
"credentials, and artifact-handling rules belong below."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/cursor_cloud_supplement.md:11
msgid "Cloud VM tooling"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/cursor_cloud_supplement.md:13
msgid ""
"Repeatable installs (Docker, Node, npm dependencies, `agent-browser`, AWS"
" CLI, Playwright Chromium) belong in the Cursor Cloud VM update script, "
"not in this file. The cloud image additionally provides:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/cursor_cloud_supplement.md:17
msgid "`agent-browser` — browser automation for agents without a desktop."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/cursor_cloud_supplement.md:18
msgid ""
"AWS CLI — uploads non-sensitive reproduction artifacts to "
"`AWS_S3_BUCKET_NAME`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/cursor_cloud_supplement.md:21
msgid "Running Mattermost + plugin locally in the cloud VM"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/cursor_cloud_supplement.md:23
msgid ""
"A local Mattermost Enterprise instance is needed for plugin development. "
"Use the development image and a companion PostgreSQL container:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/cursor_cloud_supplement.md:49
msgid ""
"The development image provides an Entry license for local testing; "
"`MM_LICENSE` is not required."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/cursor_cloud_supplement.md:52
msgid "Deploying the plugin into the cloud VM container"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/cursor_cloud_supplement.md:62
msgid ""
"Always clean `server/dist` first — a previous full `make dist` may have "
"left other-platform binaries that bloat the upload."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/cursor_cloud_supplement.md:65
msgid "Configuring an Anthropic agent via API"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/cursor_cloud_supplement.md:67
msgid ""
"After deploying the plugin and starting Mattermost, configure an "
"Anthropic service and create a user agent using the `ANTHROPIC_API_KEY` "
"environment variable. Do not use `/api/v4/config/patch` for plugin config"
" — write to `PUT /plugins/mattermost-ai/admin/config`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/cursor_cloud_supplement.md:111
msgid ""
"After this, `@claudeagent` is available for DMs and mentions. Config "
"schema lives in `config/config.go` and `llm/configuration.go`; the agent "
"API request shape is `CreateAgentRequest` in `api/api_agents.go`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/cursor_cloud_supplement.md:115
msgid ""
"Verify embedded MCP tools are discoverable: `GET /plugins/mattermost-"
"ai/admin/mcp/tools` (admin auth required)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/cursor_cloud_supplement.md:118
msgid "Uploading PR artifacts to S3"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/cursor_cloud_supplement.md:120
msgid ""
"All screenshots and walkthrough videos captured during development must "
"be uploaded to S3 and linked in the PR description so reviewers see "
"visual evidence of changes. Never include secrets, credentials, or API "
"keys in screenshots or videos — retake or redact instead."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/cursor_cloud_supplement.md:125
msgid ""
"Required env vars (provided as cloud secrets): `AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID`, "
"`AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY`, `AWS_S3_BUCKET_NAME`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/cursor_cloud_supplement.md:148
msgid ""
"Add image artifacts to the PR description as Markdown images "
"(`![alt](url)`) so they render inline. Use plain links for non-image "
"artifacts. Upload before creating or updating the PR description."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/cursor_cloud_supplement.md:152
msgid "Cloud-VM-specific gotchas"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/cursor_cloud_supplement.md:154
msgid ""
"The Mattermost server port comes from the Docker port mapping above "
"(`8065`); if you re-run with a different `-p` flag, look it up with "
"`docker port mm-server`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/agents/cursor_cloud_supplement.md:157
msgid ""
"Outbound LLM traffic from the container respects `HTTP_PROXY` / "
"`HTTPS_PROXY` on the Mattermost process environment if the cloud VM "
"routes egress through a proxy."
msgstr ""

